		{
			description: [
				"&7As your factory grows, so too does the challenge of managing the countless resources flowing through it. Chests quickly become cluttered, items become difficult to locate, and valuable time is wasted searching for materials.&r"
				""
				"This is where &6Tom's Simple Storage&r comes in."
				""
				"Designed to simplify storage management without requiring advanced technology, Tom's allows you to connect large collections of chests, barrels, and storage blocks into a single, easy-to-use network."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"&lBuilding a Storage Network&r:"
				""
				"At the heart of every storage system is the &6Inventory Connector&r and a network of connected inventories."
				""
				"By linking your storage together, you can access items from multiple containers through a single interface rather than searching through dozens of individual chests."
				""
				"This system serves as the backbone of your factory's logistics and will continue to grow alongside your automation infrastructure."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"While simple in design, Tom's Simple Storage provides powerful organization tools that will help keep your factory running efficiently."
				""
				"Mastering storage management today will save countless headaches tomorrow."
				""
				"After all, a successful factory is only as organized as the engineer who built it."
			]
