		{
			dependencies: ["59346870E40EDF60"]
			description: [
				"&7Now that your storage network is connected, it's time to make accessing your resources far more convenient.&r"
				""
				"The &6Storage Terminal&r and &6Crafting Terminal&r allow you to interact with your entire storage system from a single location, giving you instant access to every connected inventory."
				""
				"No more digging through rows of chests."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"&lStorage Terminal&r:"
				""
				"The Storage Terminal acts as a central access point for your network, allowing you to view, search, and retrieve items from all connected inventories."
				""
				"As your factory expands, this terminal will quickly become one of your most frequently used tools."
				""
				"Finding resources has never been easier."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"&lCrafting Terminal&r:"
				""
				"The Crafting Terminal builds upon the Storage Terminal by integrating a crafting grid directly into the interface."
				""
				"This allows you to craft items using materials stored throughout your entire network without manually gathering ingredients first."
				""
				"With everything available from a single screen, crafting becomes significantly faster and more efficient."
