		{
			dependencies: ["59346870E40EDF60"]
			description: [
				"&7A stationary terminal is useful, but the true power of a storage network is the ability to access it from anywhere.&r"
				""
				"As your factory expands and your adventures take you farther from home, constantly returning to your storage room becomes increasingly inefficient. Whether you're exploring distant planets, constructing massive production lines, or gathering resources far from base, your storage network should always be within reach."
				""
				"The solution lies in wireless technology."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"&lWireless Terminals&r:"
				""
				"Using the &6Wireless Terminal&r, you can remotely access your storage network without being physically connected to it. This allows you to retrieve resources, organize items, and manage your inventory while working elsewhere in your factory or exploring the world around you."
				""
				"For many engineers, the Wireless Terminal quickly becomes an indispensable tool."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"&lAdvanced Wireless Terminals&r:"
				""
				"As your needs grow, you can further upgrade your remote access capabilities through &6Advanced Wireless Terminals&r."
				""
				"These powerful upgrades provide enhanced range and functionality, allowing your storage network to remain accessible across larger distances and more demanding environments. Whether you're managing multiple factory complexes or preparing for off-world expeditions, advanced wireless access ensures your resources are always close at hand."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"With wireless storage technology fully deployed, your network evolves beyond a simple warehouse."
				""
				"No matter where your journey takes you—from the depths of a mine to the farthest reaches of the solar system—your resources remain only a few clicks away."
				""
				"A truly advanced factory doesn't just store items."
				""
				"It keeps them available wherever they're needed."
			]
