		{
			dependencies: ["59346870E40EDF60"]
			description: [
				"&7A storage system is only as effective as the connections that hold it together.&r"
				""
				"As your factory grows, so too will the number of inventories you need to manage. Chests, barrels, drawers, and other storage blocks can all be linked together into a single network through the use of &6Cable Connectors&r."
				""
				"These components serve as the foundation of a scalable storage infrastructure, allowing your network to expand alongside your factory."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"&lCable Connectors&r:"
				""
				"Cable Connectors allow you to link inventories to your storage network, making their contents accessible through your terminals and wireless devices."
				""
				"By strategically placing connectors and cables, you can create large, centralized storage systems spanning entire buildings or even multiple factory sections."
				""
				"The larger your operation becomes, the more important a well-designed network will be."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"A properly connected storage network eliminates clutter, improves efficiency, and keeps resources organized as production increases."
