			description: [
				"&7As your storage network grows, organization becomes just as important as capacity.&r"
				""
				"Without proper sorting, valuable resources can quickly become lost among thousands of items. Fortunately, Tom's Simple Storage provides powerful filtering tools to help keep your network organized and efficient."
				""
				"Filters allow you to control how items move through your storage system and determine where specific resources should be stored."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
