				"&lUsing Filters&r:"
				""
				"Filters can be applied to storage inventories to prioritize specific items, ensuring resources are directed exactly where you want them."
				""
				"Whether you're separating ores from building materials, organizing processed goods, or reserving storage space for critical resources, filters provide precise control over your logistics network."
				""
				"A well-filtered storage system is easier to manage and significantly more efficient."
